[00:04.89]1. There was a reason why God brought the truth to you
[00:08.25]And called you from the darkness to the light.
[00:14.01]Within your heart, he saw the longing that you had
[00:21.31]To search for him and practice what is right.
[00:28.41]You promised him in prayer to do his will;
[00:34.36]He helped you then, and he will help you still.
[00:37.76](Chorus)
[00:41.16]With Jesus’ blood He bought you,
[00:44.56]to God you now belong.
[00:47.96]So he will make you firm,
[00:51.36]and he will make you strong.
[00:54.56]He’ll guide you and protect you,
[00:57.76]as he has all along.
[02:21.16]Yes, he will make you firm,
[02:24.76]and he will make you strong.
[02:47.52]2. God gave his own beloved Son in your behalf;
[02:55.04]On this account, He wants you to succeed.
[03:00.76]If He did not withhold the gift of His dear Son,
[03:07.96]Then never doubt He’ll give the strength you need.
[03:15.07]He won’t forget the faith and love you’ve shown;
[03:21.47]He will not fail to care for all His own.
[03:27.97](Chorus)
[03:30.13]With Jesus’ blood He bought you,
[03:32.30]to God you now belong.
[03:34.75]So he will make you firm,
[03:38.35]and he will make you strong.
[03:41.35]He’ll guide you and protect you,
[03:44.35]as he has all along.
[03:48.05]Yes, he will make you firm,
[03:53.37]and he will make you strong.